          "created": "2026-08-19T18:38:42.000Z",
          "author": "crosstheeceo",
          "author_fans": 7162,
          "text": "Just when they thought I was done for the summer\u2026\n\nI STARTED DESIGNING FALL/WINTER. \ud83d\ude2d\n\nIntroducing the SCULPT MUSE HEEL COLLECTION by CrossTheeCeo X @DLDPT.\n\nAnd dolls, these are NOT the wedges. This is an entirely new extension of Sculpt Muse\u2014real wood construction, metal detailing, sculptural silhouettes, and four different designs coming in suede and classic material options. I\u2019m just obsessed with these mockups.\n\nThe price point? WORTH IT. The details? Worth it. The looks that are about to be served in these all Fall/Winter? I already know y\u2019all are about to go CRAZY.\n\nSeeing another collection that started in my head actually come to life will never get old. I\u2019m so thankful that I get to keep designing, creating, experimenting, and giving the dolls something they haven\u2019t seen from DLDPT before.\n\nAnd the craziest part is\u2026 this isn\u2019t even the only collection I\u2019m rolling out. \ud83d\udc40\n\nWe\u2019re going back to where Fall/Winter started for DLDPT with the return of Fur Seasons, while introducing an entirely new era with Sculpt Muse Heels.\n\nFall/Winter 2026 is about to be RIDICULOUS.\n\nI love it. I love it. I LOVE ITTTT. \ud83d\ude2d\n\nTHE SCULPT MUSE HEEL COLLECTION \u2014 COMING SOON.\n\nWhich pair are the dolls claiming first? \ud83d\udc40\n\n#FootwearDesigner #creativedirector #DLDPT ",
          "hashtags": [
